<p>A controller is a plain class whose public methods answer routes. Extend
<code>Pop\Controller\AbstractController</code>, give it a method per action, and name the pair in the route table.</p>
<h2 id="a-controller-and-its-actions">A Controller and Its Actions<a class="anchor" href="#a-controller-and-its-actions" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>The smallest controller that a <code>controller</code>/<code>action</code> route can dispatch:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
